item-refs.tsv is generated by packaging/data/generate_item_refs.py from two sources.

Its items' names and art come from Exiled Exchange 2's item database
(renderer/public/data/en/items.ndjson and renderer/public/data/ru/items.ndjson), and the trade stats
keying each base's implicit lines from its stat database (renderer/public/data/en/stats.ndjson);
the stat direction table in crates/stat-filters/src/better.rs is taken from that stat database too.
